# Galion, Elvenking's Butler, a 4/4: "... Its base power and toughness become equal to Galion's power and toughness until end of
# turn." Galion's actual power and toughness as the ability resolves, not his base ones (the ruling): Bot1 answers the trigger with
# Giant Growth on Galion, so the Ornithopter becomes a 7/7.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Galion, Elvenking's Butler
Ornithopter
Giant Growth
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Galion, Elvenking's Butler.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Galion, Elvenking's Butler > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Giant Growth.Cast(Galion, Elvenking's Butler)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Galion, Elvenking's Butler.Power = 7
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 7
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 7
